<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Information model that imitates the OPC UA server of a Siemens S7-1500 with
  the standard SIMATIC server interface; it is not a Siemens file. Loaded after
  the DI NodeSet, the namespaces below
  map to server namespace index 3 (SIMATIC) and 2 (DI).

  The address space collects what the published Siemens documents, a STEP 7
  export of the standard interface, and client reports show: the PLC object
  below Objects and DeviceSet, its device properties and area folders, the
  SIMATIC data types, the CPU operating states, the data blocks and tags of
  the Siemens example programs, memory tags with the clock memory, and the
  method instances with their Static data. docs/references.md lists the
  source of every item and names the items that are choices of this model,
  because no source shows them: array lengths that a screenshot cuts off, the
  name of the structure of "myUdt", the tags of "DataTypes", argument names
  of two methods, and NodeIds of nodes below a method instance.

  This file is written by tools/simatic-nodeset.pl from plc.json and the XML
  files below nodeset/. Edit those and run "make nodeset", not this file.
-->
